Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.75,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Hay trucos en GTA 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.23,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Sí… pero no puedes\Nusarlos desde
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.40,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}el principio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.77,0:00:07.64,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Primero tienes\Nque terminar la
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:08.93,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}historia principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.95,0:00:10.82,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Después aparece\Nuna sección de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:12.72,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}trucos en el\Nmenú de progreso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:14.77,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Y cada truco se\Ngana superando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:16.22,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}un reto dentro\Ndel juego.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:17.03,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Ojo:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:19.30,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}según varias guías,\Nsi activas uno,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:21.46,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}en esa partida no\Npuedes guardar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:24.22,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Las guías hablan de\N61 trucos, aunque
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.98,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Rockstar no ha publicado\Nuna lista oficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:30.06,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Prefieres los trucos\Nde antes, con botones?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:30.75,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Comenta.
